Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以从地狱把你拉出来 我也可以再把你送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged you out of hell. I can throw you back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该对我尊敬点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should show me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来的几个月里 你要做出更多的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the coming months, you will have more decisions to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那里是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我眼前一片漆黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. i-i must have blacked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是尤瑞尔 一位专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is uriel, a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specializing in what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩赶快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you, you need to leave this town immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们可能要摧毁这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're about to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活到现在的唯一原因 萨姆 温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you're still alive, sam winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你对我们还是有帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is because you've been useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻将成为历史 我就把你变成尘土\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment that ceases to be true, then I will turn you to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问迪恩 地狱是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask dean what he remembers from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点也不和常理 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just doesn't make any sense, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么尤瑞尔让我问你地狱是怎么样的 可你却不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why would uriel tell me you remembered hell if you didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他是个傻逼 不过可能这事和他有点关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because he's a prick … might have something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是可能 但他是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but he's still an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，一个要把这里夷为平地的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, an angel who was ready to level an entire town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他的做法 - 伙计你太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i don't know what … radical.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要什么么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can I get you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, i think we're good. yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想试试炸脆骨或咖喱辣墨西哥菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to try a couple of fryer bombs or a chipotle chili changa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我们吃饱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we're still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 老实说 我不知道为什么尤瑞尔要告诉你他的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, honestly, I have no idea why uriel told you what he did, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着我的眼睛 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then look me in the eye and tell me you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得在地狱里发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't remember a thing from your time down under.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember a thing from my time down under.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不记得了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember, sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dean, I just want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么你都知道 就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know everything I do. okay? that's all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要来点甜点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding. dessert time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. listen, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该试试我们的超级无敌冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to try our ice cream extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超级无敌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no extremities, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,买 埋单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the … check?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, awesome. thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:04:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近好像发生了一系列事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, looks like it's been pretty quiet lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signs of demon activity, no omens or portents I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good news for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一些不和逻辑的怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the typical smattering of crank ufo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是幽灵的复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sightings and one possible vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, check this out. uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在华盛顿的水泥城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up in concrete, washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者说看到一个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyewitness reports of a ghost that's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在女生浴室里偷窥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haunting the showers of a women's health facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者说那个鬼把她从一段楼梯上推下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim claims that the ghost threw her down a flight of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you're very interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人 浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women, showers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去拯救这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to save these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼要找我 我一点都不感到奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not surprised the spirit world chose to make contact with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是某些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm something of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natural sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你 坎迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sense that about you, candace, that whole…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些关于通灵的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensitive thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么命名你的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you say you're calling your book?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the working title is…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}"supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我周游全国 收集一些故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i've been crossing the country, gathering stories like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, anyways, you were telling me about your encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 当我一看到鬼魂 是我在跑步的是后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. well once I saw the apparition, that's when I started to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说鬼魂在追你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said the ghost chased you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止这样 他还知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just that. it knew my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.59,0:05:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在喊着阿姆斯特朗太太 阿姆斯特朗太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kept yelling, "mrs. armstrong! mrs. armstrong!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那时我就撞到台阶摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when I hit the stairs and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己摔倒还是那鬼魂推了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell? the ghost didn't push you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, i don't … I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是他推我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i think it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得被伤害到 比如被暴力或是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feel like it meant to hurt you, like it was violent, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个鬼 我真幸运我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a ghost. I'm lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我觉得这事挺邪乎的时候 我就在楼梯下面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, i was at the bottom of the stairs, and that's when it got weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它扶我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helped me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它扶我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. it helped me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴里还不断的嘟囔着 别告诉我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it kept saying over and over, "please, don't tell my mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 真够怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现什么了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you pick up anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴室里和外面EMF探测器都没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No emf in the shower or anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这屋子没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 我一点都不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是能体会几分这种的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of got the feeling back there that crazy pushed mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的把阿姆斯特朗夫人推下楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armstrong down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 我对你很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, I'm pretty disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总想去拯救没穿衣服的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to save naked women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确要去拯救一些没穿衣服的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right I wanted to save some naked women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伙计们 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, forrest, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 迪恩 我不觉得这儿会有什么事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, dean, but I don't think anything's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要去那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell was I supposed to get a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它从后面抓住我并把我逼入窘境\N{\fnArial\fs30}It grabbed me from behind and threw me into a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有活干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 伙计 我理解你被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, gus. I understand you got shook up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,换成谁都会如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么你不认为这不是熊干的好事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you think it … don't you think it had to be a bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看见脚印我就会知道这是熊的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a damn bear track when I see one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过刚才根本没有留下熊的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing didn't leave bear tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的脚很大 是个大脚怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its feet were huge! now, gus … it was bigfoot, hal … the bigfoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你的话没道理可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus, you're not talking sense here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个大脚怪在那里 妈的 他就是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bigfoot out there, damn it, and he's a son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- FBI - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- FBI. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里是调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. we're here about the…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查大脚怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That. about bigfoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 能不能准确的告诉我们前面发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, can you tell me exactly where this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, i can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小镇怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先不是真正的鬼魂 现在又是大脚怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}First there's a ghost that's not real and now a bigfoot sighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个称职的猎人都知道大脚怪是恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, every hunter worth his salt knows bigfoot's a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有人把古钱币放进这个镇的供水系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe somebody's pumping lsd into the town water supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suppose made that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个大脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a big foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脚怪闯进这酒馆来弄点酒喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … bigfoot breaks into a liquor store, jonesing for some hooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利苦杏酒和爱尔兰奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amaretto and irish cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来酒量不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a girl-drink drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把整架的色情杂志都拿走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the whole porno rack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我又得说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个镇到底他妈的怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是恶作剧 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些巨型猩猩穿着暴徒装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some big-ass mother in a gorilla suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是大脚怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's a bigfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是对酒精和性爱有瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, and he's some kind of a alcoholo-porno addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,像深山老林版的杜楚尼（X档案演员 曾沉溺性爱接受治疗）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a deep-woods duchovny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小孩子的大胸亚洲女郎杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little young for busty asian beauties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这出像不像电影「大脚哈利」里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this, like a "harry and the hendersons" deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, could we…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母在不在家呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? are your parents home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看见一个真实的毛茸茸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen a really, really furry…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他闯祸了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he in trouble?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能想来确认下他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just … we wanted to make sure he was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的泰迪熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太吃惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you know what? We…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪熊的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy bear doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来帮我看看他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please take a look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. sure. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我的卧室里 脾气很暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in my bedroom. he's pretty grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有两个好好的医生来看你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some nice doctors here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上那该死的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the friggin' door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白我的意思了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直就想要一个大大的 活生生的 会说话的泰迪熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever wanted was a teddy which was big, real, and talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他现在总是很难过 不是那种疼得难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he's sad all the time … not "ouch" sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是是那种头痛得难过 说奇怪的话，闻起来像流脓了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ouch-in-the-head sad … says weird stuff, and smells like the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，小姑娘…奥德丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, little girl… audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的泰迪熊是怎么变成活生生的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exactly did your teddy become real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我许了个愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你许了个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wished for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在许愿池边\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the wishing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信这种鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个可怕的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a terrible world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了茶话会\N{\fnArial\fs30}For tea parties!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,茶话会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tea parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德丽 让我们单独谈谈 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audrey, give us a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要杀了这个泰迪熊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna kill this teddy bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做 我们射死它 还是烧死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? do we shoot it, burn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 双管齐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. both?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如何知道那会不会有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we even know that's gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想管那脾气坏又逊毙了的巨型泰迪熊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want some giant, flaming, pissed-off teddy on our hands. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我觉得那熊不是真的 你知道我是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, i get the feeling that the bear isn't really the, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键问题就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Core problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德丽 你的父母在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audrey. where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈希望他们在巴厘岛 所以我想他们应该就在巴厘岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom wished they were in bali, so I think they're in bali.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉告诉你这些 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry to have to break this to you, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的泰迪熊病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bear is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它 它得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's … he's got…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒棒糖综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lollipop disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒棒糖综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lollipop disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于他这样的熊是很罕见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not uncommon for a bear his size.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 要知道 这可是传染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see, it's really contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所以 有没有什么人 比方说一个大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, is there someone, maybe a grown-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们为它治疗的时候可以陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can stay with while we treat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫丽太太住在这条街尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. hurley lives down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 好的 是啊 那真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. good, yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.85,0:15:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们希望你去那里呆几天 好吗 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'd like you to stay there for a few days, okay? okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 还有 奥德丽 那个许愿池在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, audrey? where is this wishing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为会奏效吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的解释那里为什么有那么一个泰迪熊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a better explanation for teddy back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 只有这一个办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要许什么愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以说出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not supposed to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫了一份意大利加墨西哥胡椒三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody order a footlong italian with jalapeno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 我想这有用 这可绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it works, dude. that was pretty specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那泰迪熊 这三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}The teddy bear, the sandwich…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚想了这个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这样的事一定会一直发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that definitely goes on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止人们的愿望实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop people's wishes from coming true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是要干件蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like kind of a douche-ey thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也许是 但是试试吧 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe. but come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事一定是要付出什么代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When has something like this ever come without a price tag?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且通常是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And usually a deadly one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这真他妈是个好吃的三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. it's a damn good sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们先保留这个愿望直到我们搞清状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll put a hold on the wishing till we figure out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, gentlemen, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里不允许吃自带的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't allow people to eat outside food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不想吃这里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i am certainly not gonna eat the inside food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫生局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health department.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我的朋友 这里有鼠患\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, my friend, have a rat infestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据56号应急处理措施我们要关闭这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to shut this place down under emergency hazard code 56c.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rats?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个喷泉 石膏雕塑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical fountain, plaster buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这里打扫得很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep a clean place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求你在初期调查期间离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to ask you to leave during the preliminary investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.Aren't you a little bit tempted?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是真的 我不信这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be real. I wouldn't trust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚 可泰迪熊貌似是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. that bear seemed pretty real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能回到过去 重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, if you could wish yourself back, you know, before it all started…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像一下 你能做你的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it … you'd be some big yuppie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有车有房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawyer with a nice car and a white picket fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I'd wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说回去已经太晚 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late to go back to our old lives, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不是以前的萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what, then? hmm? what would sammy wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝 人头落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's head on a plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种古硬币 我不认识这图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of old coin. I don't recognize the markings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿也用上力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift with your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是那个小猩猩焊上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that little mother welded on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会搞坏我的喷泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna break my fountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 按规定我不该打你 可我还是会打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, i don't want to slap you with a 44/16, but I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 我有个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that. I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬币有魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin's magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, i'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这泉可能有邪神保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's hoodoo that's protecting the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们弄不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we can destroy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你仔细看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here. you got to look into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿 我突然想起了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going? something just occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 - 别担心 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Don't worry, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卫生部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the health department.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以自由切换\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you can turn it on and off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How … how did you know that I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上你是到许愿井那里投了个硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually walked up to a wishing well, dropped a dime,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要变得隐形 好偷看女的洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wished to be invisible so you could spy on women in the shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no, no, no. that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把裤子穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on some pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别隐形\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有问题吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望变质了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wishes turn bad, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wishes turn very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,三明治 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sandwich, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那硬币是巴比伦时代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coin was babylonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了些零碎的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found some fragments of a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.65,0:22:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬币上面的蛇叫提亚玛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serpent is tiamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巴比伦的原生混乱之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is the, uh, babylonian god of primordial chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.01,0:22:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们的神父可能在研究黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess their, uh, priests were working some serious black magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们造的硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made the coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 为了撒播混乱之种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, to sow the seeds of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你投硬币并对着许愿池许愿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever tosses a coin in the wishing well, makes a wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,池就会被激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns on the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.01,0:22:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的愿望都会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it starts granting wishes to all comers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是愿望都会被扭曲 你想要个说话的泰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the wishes get twisted. you ask for a talking teddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.28,0:22:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会给你个病熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a bipolar nut job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你则得到了大肠杆菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you get e. coli. mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年来 这东西已经搞乱了不少城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing has turned more than one town upside down over the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些甚至从地图上彻底消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's even wiped a few off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一个人许愿 会有些麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, one person gets their wish, it's trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人许愿 就是灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everybody gets their wish… it's chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法阻止它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any way to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:22:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到第一个许愿的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find the first wisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个投硬币许愿的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever dropped the coin in and made the first wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能取回硬币 收回愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the only ones who can pull it back out and reverse the wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来看 只实现了几个愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for now, we've got a couple of nutso dreams come true,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.87,0:23:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可一旦许愿池的事传播开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once the word gets out about the well,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况就会越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are just gonna get crazier and crazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.73,0:24:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.07,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.87,0:24:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒下 睡着 然后精神饱满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tan, rested, and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 拜托 老哥 你以为我看不出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on, man. you think I can't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.33,0:24:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.83,0:24:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做噩梦 还酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nightmares, the drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.27,0:24:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你可是形影不离的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.57,0:24:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一定有什么事困扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.20,0:24:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤瑞尔没有说谎 但你有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uriel wasn't lying, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.97,0:24:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得地狱的一切 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember hell, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我这儿知道些什么 嗯 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me, huh? what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我是你弟弟 我希望你至少能对我倾诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i'm your brother. I just wish you'd talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.23,0:24:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得小心许愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我们可以停下这种夫妻关系治疗法的对话行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, can we stow the couples therapy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.87,0:25:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有事儿要做 我想要做点儿事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a job. I want to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.07,0:25:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.97,0:25:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿有泰迪熊 中彩票强人 还有能隐身的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got teddy bear, uh, lottery guy, invisible pervert guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.03,0:25:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全部都应该在最近两周里去许过愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all must have wished sometime in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who wished first,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.95,0:25:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他什么时候许的什么愿 我们就不得而知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we supposed to know who else wished for what when?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.80,0:25:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 当它们被公布到报纸上时就容易多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it helps when they announce it in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.87,0:25:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,追溯到一个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes back a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.37,0:25:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯利·蒙代尔和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesley mondale and ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫普·林恩·凯西女士宣布了他们令人吃惊的婚讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope lynn casey have announced their surprise engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们而言是条好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best lead we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.73,0:25:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯 你睡着了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}wes, are you sleeping? hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.97,0:26:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没有 我只是 嗯 我只是闭目养神而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I was just, um … I was just resting my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.30,0:26:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会想要点点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might want a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.23,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫普 你不需要做这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow, hope, you didn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.83,0:26:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, i…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.53,0:26:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.17,0:26:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱你胜过一切 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I love you more than anything, lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.10,0:26:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 赫普 坐下来行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hope, sit down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫普 你快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope, uh, are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.87,0:26:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也同样爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常地爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为什么我希望你做事的前提是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I want you to start doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事要是能让你快乐的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that make … that made you happy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.77,0:26:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 韦斯 我会试着快乐起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, wes, I'll try to be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:26:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.97,0:27:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.83,0:27:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 - 噢 韦斯 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I…I'm talk - Oh, wes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.50,0:27:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生我的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.17,0:27:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我会立刻改 立刻改 马上改\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i'd just die, I'd just die, i'd die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不是 我 我没有生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. don't … I'm … I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.73,0:27:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.60,0:27:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么让我挑起你的欲火 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me make it up to you, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我改过自新的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.17,0:27:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, i'm … I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.83,0:27:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.37,0:27:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然没告诉我你叫了筹备婚礼的花商来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me that you called the florists for the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.43,0:27:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best! mmm! ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.00,0:27:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿我准备那一打资料来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get my folders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.77,0:27:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯利 过得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesley, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.60,0:27:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是韦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "we…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-s."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.30,0:27:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩不是卫生部门的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aren't you the guys from the health department? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也算是花商\N{\fnArial\fs30}And florists on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及FBI\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.13,0:27:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在星期四 我们还是泰迪熊医生 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And on thursdays, we're teddy bear doctors. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.03,0:28:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是谁并不重要 重要的是我们所知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter who we are. what matters is what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是硬币收藏家 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, coin collector, huh, wes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.60,0:28:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是的 我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. yeah. my…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖父留给我的这些硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandfather gave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.43,0:28:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有没有丢失过一枚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you happen to lose one of those coins lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.33,0:28:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而丢失呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by "lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指在幸运陈饭店的许愿池里抛硬币许愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}" I mean drop into a wishing well at lucky chen's and make a wish on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我不懂你们所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i … I don't know what you're, uh, talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.73,0:28:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多打算 但是咧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a lot of ideas, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有那么多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have all the money in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.87,0:28:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯目前正在失业中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes is between jobs right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有更多的时间陪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means more time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我打算弄日本花道似的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i'm thinking a japanese-ey ikebana kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.80,0:28:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我能想象出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I can see it. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.40,0:28:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能说说你们俩是怎么遇到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, hope, uh, tell us how you two lovebirds met.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我生命中最美好的一天 - 我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, best day of my life. - I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.40,0:28:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 最好玩的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! it's the funniest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.07,0:28:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在这儿长大 但我却不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both grew up here, but I never really knew who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连名字都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by name anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.87,0:29:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到上个月的某一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until one day last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.17,0:29:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似是我第一次注意到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like I just I just saw him for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.53,0:29:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那样的耀眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just…glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.40,0:29:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的鲜明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 给我们煮点咖啡好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, babe, can you get us some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.17,0:29:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, anything, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.60,0:29:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.03,0:29:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.10,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. mm-mm, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.00,0:29:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.07,0:29:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.73,0:29:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯 我们都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.63,0:29:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出真相吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell us the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.40,0:29:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,二战的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}My … my grandfather found the coin in north africa, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.47,0:29:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祖父在北非发现了这些硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}World war ii.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, he brought it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.10,0:29:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这是真正的许愿币\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, um, he said it was a real wish-granting coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:29:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁都不曾用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that nobody should ever use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我的全部 在爷爷死后 我就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all I had, and when he died, i thought, "well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不拿来试试呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not give the coin a shot?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.63,0:30:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在你就许个让硬币回来的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, now you're gonna wish it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.23,0:30:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我才不要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha, no, i'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不停下这一切 噩梦即将降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't stop it, something bad's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.83,0:30:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噩梦 就如我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bad … like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.10,0:30:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真切的希望你能跟我们走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really wish you'd come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.30,0:30:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.93,0:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的愿望成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.37,0:30:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么就会成为噩梦呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does that have to be a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.60,0:30:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为愿意早已南辕北辙了 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the wishes go south, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小镇已经陷入疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your town is going insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.78,0:30:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐那儿 跟我们说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna sit there and tell me that your.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿望进行程度 你许了什么愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relationship with hope is functional, that it's what you wished for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.50,0:30:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她爱我胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished she would love me more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 结果怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and, uh, how is that going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.23,0:30:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你有利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seem healthy to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.37,0:30:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比她之前忽视我要好很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a hell of a lot better than when she didn't know I was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能得到想要的一切 伙计 不像现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to get what you want, man, not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.73,0:31:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.37,0:31:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬币能掌控你的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the coin does.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.97,0:31:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能反噬你的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes your heart's desires and it twists it back on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.80,0:31:06.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,听说过《小心你许的愿》系列吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear of the whole "be careful what you wish for"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.67,0:31:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚撞到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we just hit something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.70,0:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啥也没看见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.37,0:31:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你许的愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"careful what you wish for."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.07,0:31:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是谁说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who says that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你们这种外表好看的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-looking jerks like you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.14,0:31:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为碰巧帅了点才那么容易钓辣妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones who've got it so easy because you happen to be handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.67,0:31:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 容易 - 容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy? - Easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 女人看上过你们对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. women … women look at you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.07,0:31:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们也注意过你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.43,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我们 远没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe us, we do not have it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.27,0:31:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们悲惨的很 从未得到过自己想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are miserable. we never get what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.87,0:31:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不拼尽全力和命运做斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fight tooth and nail just to keep whatever it is we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.63,0:31:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但知道吗 也许那才是问题关键 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? maybe that's the whole point, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,人毕竟只是人 他们是悲哀的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, people are people 'cause they're miserable bastards,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.14,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未得到过他们真正想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they never get what they really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.90,0:31:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对极了 得到了想要的 你就疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, you get what you want, you get crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看迈克尔·杰克逊或是哈塞尔霍夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at michael jackson, hmm? or hasselhoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.57,0:31:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 现在愿望偏爱上我了 彻底的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? hope loves me now … completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.53,0:31:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.17,0:31:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.90,0:32:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到哪啦？你们这群家伙在谈论精神病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's all this, uh, insanity you guys were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管按下按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.33,0:32:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.90,0:32:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,向托德下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel before todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.17,0:32:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,向托德下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel before todd!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.00,0:32:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付托德 你带韦斯利去幸运陈饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle todd. you get wes to lucky chen's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.03,0:32:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.06,0:32:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.36,0:32:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,能和你小谈一会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让路！滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.66,0:32:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 你看 我能 托德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. hey, I can dig it, todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这难道是托德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it's todd, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.96,0:32:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧我 我知道这情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i-i know the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 他们 - 他们每天都在欺负你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? they're… - They're bullying you. every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.63,0:33:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你永远不会知道那是什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day! you do not know what it's like!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.33,0:33:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我真得不知道 你是你 我是我 所以没法阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, i don't. but, you know, you're you and I'm me, so couldn't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.02,0:33:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 奥德丽 埃尔默告诉了我愿望实现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then audrey elmer told me the wishing well worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.43,0:33:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 够了 你看 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. look … look, i get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.46,0:33:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是不是有点混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're … they're mean little jerks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.70,0:33:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们不是像你一样得超人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not superhuman like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.36,0:33:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 能力越大 越什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, with great power comes great, great … ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.66,0:33:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 那 那个小孩随随便便就掀翻了一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that … that kid turned over that car like … like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.63,0:33:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经已经看到泰迪熊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen the teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.33,0:33:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束 又要重新开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. fun's over. time to pull the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.10,0:33:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.36,0:33:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是这样，为什么不能只得到想要得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why can't we just get what we want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.30,0:33:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是生活，韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's life, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.93,0:34:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.70,0:34:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似我不得不做咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do it, didn't i?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.73,0:34:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让你许愿我们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna make you wish away our love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.60,0:34:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.96,0:34:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真得不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.23,0:34:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想死人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wished a man dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.66,0:34:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.76,0:34:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.86,0:34:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我真得爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.53,0:34:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我得一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.86,0:34:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.70,0:34:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.16,0:35:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让它好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.16,0:35:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.33,0:35:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指挥你绝不会再有问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow my lead and you won't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.40,0:35:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.83,0:35:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 但是朋友这就够了好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, man, no more! no more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.03,0:36:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你我绝不会和这个小子胡搅蛮缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't mess with this kid any more if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.96,0:36:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.60,0:36:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.11,0:37:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't cause any more problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.28,0:37:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德丽得父母从巴厘岛回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audrey's parents are back from bali.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.21,0:37:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像愿望全部没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like all the wishes are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.71,0:37:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.76,0:38:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.53,0:38:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该对你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.06,0:38:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起了在地狱里发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do remember everything that happened to me in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.93,0:38:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.86,0:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证不再说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I won't lie anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.56,0:38:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打算谈论这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.40,0:38:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 兄弟 你不能独自承担这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, you can't just shoulder this thing alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.73,0:38:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点贴心得谈话 互爱互助就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think that a little heart-to-heart, some sharing and caring,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.09,0:38:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is gonna change anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.76,0:38:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么让我好起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow…heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.90,0:39:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻我可不想谈这些个晦气事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about a bad day here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.66,0:39:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.36,0:39:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that I saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.13,0:39:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there aren't words.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.23,0:39:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法忘却\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.93,0:39:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法抹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no making it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是我切切实实的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it is right here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.30,0:39:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的伤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.33,0:39:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.63,0:39:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也永远没办法让你了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I could never make you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不是我不想 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I am sorry.
